## Development guidelines

- Follow established language idioms, naming conventions, and architecture.
- Keep changes focused and handle errors explicitly.
- Use the configured formatter, linter, and static-analysis tools.
- Add dependencies only when their maintenance, security, licensing, and compatibility costs are justified.{% if project_conventions %}
- {{ project_conventions }}{% endif %}

